  "decision": "Reject before runtime work or a W7900 gate. Even the best zero-workspace heuristic is 30.94% slower than retained exact Q4T16 at M512 with 0/7 wins, so the route is not uniformly non-regressive across the required 512/1K/4K matrix. The large-row wins are real but insufficient to override that failure, and a live hipBLASLt handle additionally consumes 172 MiB outside hipEngine's tracked arena. Preserve the existing exact-T16 and bounded rocBLAS owners; do not add a hipBLASLt runtime dependency for this path."
